---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/site-path';
import '../styles/creator-room.css';
---
<figure class="creator-room" data-creator-room data-creator-character={sitePath('/media/creator-room/creator-character-v18.glb')} data-room-state="waiting" aria-label="夜间微缩创作工作室：一位戴眼镜的卡通成年创作者，在环绕桌面的三块屏幕前阅读、编程与思考。移动指针，观察空间与人物的回应。">
  <div class="creator-room__stage" data-creator-stage>
    <canvas class="creator-room__canvas" data-creator-canvas aria-hidden="true" hidden></canvas>
    <div class="creator-room__fallback" data-creator-fallback>
      <picture class="creator-room__poster" data-creator-poster-slot aria-hidden="true"><source media="(max-width:700px)" srcset={sitePath('/media/creator-room-poster-mobile.webp')}/><img src={sitePath('/media/creator-room-poster.webp')} width="1180" height="710" alt="" decoding="async"/></picture>
      <div class="creator-room__fallback-copy"><p data-creator-status>创作空间的静帧。</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="creator-room__caption"><p>动画示意，屏幕内容为虚构片段。</p><button type="button" data-creator-motion-toggle hidden disabled aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="pause" size={16}/><span data-creator-motion-label>暂停场景</span></button></figcaption>
  <noscript><p class="creator-room__notice">当前以静帧呈现创作空间，介绍与交流入口仍可正常使用。</p></noscript>
</figure>
